{% set violation_lines = [] %}
{% for v in violations %}
{%- set line = "[" ~ v.code ~ " / " ~ violation_label(v.code) ~ "] " ~ (v.description or '') %}
{%- if v.amount is defined and v.amount and v.amount != 0 %}
{%- set line = line ~ " (amount involved: " ~ v.amount | format_currency(currency or 'USD') ~ ")" %}
{%- endif %}
{%- set _ = violation_lines.append(line) %}
{%- endfor %}
Subject:Formal complaint regarding {{ employer_name or '[Name of Respondent]' }}

To: {{ recipient_name or '[Recipient]' }},

Dear Sir or Madam,

My name is {{ complainant_name or '[Complainant]' }} (contact: {{ complainant_contact or '[contact]' }}).
I am writing to formally report serious violations of labour rights committed by
{{ employer_name or '[Name of Respondent]' }} and respectfully request an investigation
in accordance with applicable laws and ILO conventions.

## 1. Parties

- Complainant: {{ complainant_name or '[Complainant]' }}
- Contact:      {{ complainant_contact or '[contact]' }}
- Employer:     {{ employer_name or '[Respondent]' }}
- Position / Workplace: {{ position or '[position]' }} / {{ workplace or '[workplace]' }}
- Employment period: {{ employment_start or '[start date]' }} to {{ employment_end or 'present' }}

## 2. Alleged Violations

{% for line in violation_lines -%}
- {{ line }}
{% endfor %}
Further details (dates, locations, persons involved) are documented in the attached
evidence pack.

## 3. Evidence Submitted

This submission is accompanied by {{ evidence_count }} pieces of evidence. The
complete index and SHA-256 integrity hashes are recorded in
`evidence_index.json`; original files are stored under `evidence/`.

{% if summary -%}
## 4. Case Summary

{{ summary }}

{% endif -%}
## 5. Requested Actions

1. Open an investigation into {{ employer_name or '[Respondent]' }}.
2. Order the employer to remediate all violations, including payment of outstanding
   wages, overtime compensation, social-insurance contributions, and any
   compensation for occupational injury.
3. Hold responsible persons accountable under applicable law.
4. Protect the complainant from retaliation.

## 6. Declaration

The statements made above are true and accurate to the best of my knowledge.
Should any information be found untrue, I am willing to bear the corresponding
legal responsibility.

I would be grateful for your consideration and stand ready to provide further
materials upon request.

Yours faithfully,

{{ complainant_name or '[Complainant]' }}
Date: {{ today | format_date }}
